WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.030
Frederic Remington lived
from 1861 to 1909.

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.030
He studied briefly
at the Yale School of Art,

3
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.230
then headed west
on sketching trips in the 1880s.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.930
He became the visual chronicler of the cavalry,
the cowboy, and the Native warrior,

5
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.220
always from a white,

6
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:22.870
Eastern point of view that romanticized violence
and framed conquest as heroism.

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.470
Magazines like Harper's Weekly
and Collier's made him a household name.

8
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.720
He illustrated Theodore Roosevelt's writing
on ranch life,

9
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:36.810
and the two shared an idea: the West
as the testing ground of American manhood.
